ite  The biopsy site comes to within 0 2cm of the closest  anterior  blue  margin  The biopsy site is surrounded by white yellow fibrous tissue  Sections are submitted as follows  G  Biopsy cavity with closest  anterior blue  margin H J  Representative sections of biopsy cavity K  Representative sections away from biopsy cavity Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  additional deep margin  is an unoriented piece of fibrofatty breast tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm  It is sectioned and submitted entirely in L M  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  final shaved margin superior half of cavity  is an unoriented piece of fibrofatty breast tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  The specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely N P  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  final shaved margin inferior half of cavity  is an unoriented piece of fibrofatty breast tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  It is sectioned and submitted entirely in Q R  Resident  SARAH ROLLINS  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  HEIKE VARNHOLT  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Eugene Jerome Mark  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  LEFT DEEP   ADDITIONAL MARGIN PART C  BREAST  LEFT SUPERIOR HALF OF CAVITY  FINAL SHAVED PART D  BREAST  LEFT INFERIOR HALF OF CAVITY   FINAL SHAVE PART E  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION , Absent.
