Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  Final Type  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report  MS 07  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  CASE  MS 07  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REMOVED_PATIENT_NAME  Date Taken  REMOVED_DATE Source Care Unit  Same Day Surgery  WACC 3 Path Subspecialty Service  Breast 1 Results To  SARAH P THAYER  M D  Signed Out by  Melinda J Lerwill  M D  CLINICAL DATA  Right breast re excision  FINAL DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  RIGHT   RE EXCISION  HEALING BIOPSY SITE  RESIDUAL CARCINOMA IS NOT IDENTIFIED  NOTE  The resection margins of the specimen were inked and microscopically evaluated  By his her signature below  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  right breast re excision   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm oriented tan yellow lobulated portion of fibroadipose tissue with a stitch designating anterior margin and REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm skin ellipse designating lateral margin as per the requisition  The tan brown skin contains 4 0cm linear well healed scar  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior blue  posterior black  superior green  inferior yellow  There is a REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm exposed cavity on the posterior surface which grossly abuts the medial and superior margin and lies 0 6cm from inferior  0 7cm from anterior and 2 5cm from lateral margin  The rest of the breast parenchyma is focally tan white  fibrotic and contains occasional orange foci  consistent with fat necrosis  Representative sections are submitted as follows  Section Code   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Radial section medial margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  cavity exposed on posterior surface   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section  breast parenchyma away from the cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   En face section  lateral margin  Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Le